'''Snoop''' was a [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. Snoop was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.

== Appearance ==
The blade of the knife is neon green and features an image of Snoop Dogg on it. It has a silver hilt and a black handle.

== Trivia ==
* The knife is based off the Snoop Dogg, and he appears on the blade of this knife.
* When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the [[Chroma Box]], this knife had Snoop Dogg removed from the blade and was renamed [[Lime]].
